{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_guide", "label": "Datasets and Data loading guide", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Guide (mostly text-specific) to OLMo-core's builtin data loading; other modalities are supported by subclassing DataLoaderBase."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_pretokenization", "label": "Pre-tokenization requirement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Builtin data loading requires pre-tokenizing data into 1D numpy arrays of token IDs that already include special tokens (e.g. EOS) but exclude padding; the dolma project provides an optimized toolkit for producing this format."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_fsl_vs_vsl", "label": "FSL vs VSL training", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Builtin loading is either fixed-sequence-length (FSL, every instance is exactly sequence_length) or variable-sequence-length (VSL); you choose by selecting the data loader class (NumpyFSLDataLoader or ComposableDataLoader for FSL, NumpyVSLDataLoader for VSL)."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_concat_and_chunk", "label": "Concatenate-and-chunk strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Simplest FSL strategy (NumpyFSLDataset): concatenate all tokenized documents and chunk into sequence_length instances. Simple and efficient, but documents fragment across instances and each instance mixes multiple documents, producing cross-document attention that can adversely affect the model (see Zhao et al. 2024)."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_intra_document_masking", "label": "Intra-document masking", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Setting generate_doc_lengths=True on NumpyFSLDataset emits doc_lens/max_doc_lens to the model's forward(), and a compatible model applies intra-document masking internally, removing cross-document attention within concatenated instances (see the Transformer implementation)."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_document_packing", "label": "Document packing (OBFD)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NumpyPackedFSLDataset uses the Optimized Best-Fit Decreasing (OBFD) bin-packing algorithm to pack whole documents into instances with no fragmentation (except sequences longer than sequence_length) and minimal padding. OBFD is applied per source file by default (very compact for >1GB .npy files, and parallelizable to amortize startup cost); source_group_size>1 packs across consecutive files. Over-long documents are truncated or fragmented per LongDocStrategy."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_document_padding", "label": "Document padding strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NumpyPaddedFSLDataset pads each document up to sequence_length (fragmenting over-long docs), so tokens from different documents never share an instance and cross-document attention is avoided without intra-document masking; however it wastes tokens on padding when document lengths vary widely, so NumpyPackedFSLDataset is generally preferred."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_interleaved", "label": "Interleaved documents strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NumpyInterleavedFSLDataset chunks documents and interleaves the chunks to force the model to attend to tokens far apart in an instance, which may help long-range dependencies; it does not support intra-document masking since that would defeat interleaving."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_vsl_curriculum", "label": "VSL sequence-length curriculum", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NumpyVSLDataset injects a sequence-length curriculum via dataset decomposition: each instance is a unique subset of tokens from a single document (so no intra-document masking is needed); min_sequence_length and max_sequence_length must both be powers of two, every batch uses instances of one sequence length summing to global_batch_size, and a VSLCurriculum controls the sampling probability of each length over an epoch."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_custom_data_loader", "label": "Custom data loader", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Custom modalities/loaders subclass DataLoaderBase: implement _iter_batches to return only the rank-local portion of each batch (exactly rank_batch_size tokens) and implement state_dict()/load_state_dict() so the loader resumes where it left off in an epoch; NumpyDataLoaderBase is the real-world reference implementation."}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_zhao_et_al_2024", "label": "Zhao et al. (2024) - intra-document masking", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/c4673ed74c1f25a67c346dfddb4944e64b0d00a6", "captured_at": null, "author": "Zhao et al.", "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_document_packing_arxiv_2404_10830", "label": "Document packing (arXiv:2404.10830)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2404.10830", "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_source_guides_data_loading_dataset_decomposition_arxiv_2405_13226", "label": "Dataset Decomposition: Faster LLM Training with Variable Sequence Length Curriculum (Pouransari et al. 2024)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.13226", "captured_at": null, "author": "Pouransari et al.", "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_data_loader_dataloaderbase", "label": "olmo_core.data.data_loader.DataLoaderBase", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_data_loader_numpyfsldataloader", "label": "olmo_core.data.data_loader.NumpyFSLDataLoader", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_data_loader_numpyvsldataloader", "label": "olmo_core.data.data_loader.NumpyVSLDataLoader", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_numpy_dataset_numpydatasetbase", "label": "olmo_core.data.numpy_dataset.NumpyDatasetBase", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_numpy_dataset_numpyfsldataset", "label": "olmo_core.data.numpy_dataset.NumpyFSLDataset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_numpy_dataset_numpyfsldatasetmixture", "label": "olmo_core.data.numpy_dataset.NumpyFSLDatasetMixture", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_numpy_dataset_numpypackedfsldataset", "label": "olmo_core.data.numpy_dataset.NumpyPackedFSLDataset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_numpy_dataset_numpypaddedfsldataset", "label": "olmo_core.data.numpy_dataset.NumpyPaddedFSLDataset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_numpy_dataset_numpyinterleavedfsldataset", "label": "olmo_core.data.numpy_dataset.NumpyInterleavedFSLDataset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/source/guides/data_loading.rst", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_olmo_core_data_numpy_dataset_numpyvsldataset", "label": "olmo_core.data.numpy_dataset.NumpyVSLDataset", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "do